## 8. Artisan Test Commands Reference

```bash
# Run a single service's tests
cd services/student-service && php artisan test

# Run a specific test method
php artisan test --filter=test_can_create_student

# Run with coverage
php artisan test --coverage

# Run all services (from root)
cd services/student-service && php artisan test
cd ../course-service && php artisan test
cd ../enrollment-service && php artisan test
```

